WEBVTT

00:07:59.636 --> 00:08:02.276
you know, we we think,
OK, I'll go to the gym,

00:08:02.316 --> 00:08:04.556
I’ll work out, I’ll take a long walk,

00:08:04.556 --> 00:08:07.916
I'll do something to keep
myself strong and fit.

00:08:08.236 --> 00:08:10.556
But then we come home
and we don't say, I'm done,

00:08:10.596 --> 00:08:12.556
I don't ever have to do that again.

00:08:12.836 --> 00:08:16.036
We have the sense
that physical fitness is a practice

00:08:16.076 --> 00:08:19.196
that we need to maintain over time.

00:08:19.196 --> 00:08:22.676
It turns out that social
fitness is the same.

00:08:23.036 --> 00:08:25.516
That in fact, our friendships,

00:08:25.516 --> 00:08:28.676
our relationships don't just
take care of themselves,

00:08:28.676 --> 00:08:31.756
that even good relationships
need tending to,